# Line-ending normalisation is on (core.autocrlf) for most clones. Git decides
# text-vs-binary by looking for NUL bytes, which is a heuristic: a small PDF
# has none and would be rewritten LF -> CRLF on checkout, corrupting its byte
# offsets. Declare binary formats explicitly so they are never touched.

*.pdf     binary
*.pkl     binary
*.joblib  binary
*.npy     binary
*.npz     binary
*.parquet binary

*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.jpeg    binary
*.gif     binary
*.ico     binary
*.svg     text

*.exe     binary
*.dll     binary
*.bin     binary
*.yar     text
